          "title": "You'll want to know: завод",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "завод (zavód) — \"a factory\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "завод (zavód) is за-, \"start\", with вод, the root of водить, \"to lead\" (Vasmer gives водить with вести, \"to lead\"): заводить is \"to set going\", and a завод (zavód) is a works set going."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for this chapter."
